  "prefLabel": "Ban 103.04 Consumer Credit Division",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ban 103.04 Consumer Credit Division. The consumer credit division, headed by the director of consumer credit, shall conduct:\n\n(a) Examinations of each consumer credit licensee of the department;\n\n(b) Reviews of licensing applications of consumer credit entities; and\n\n(c) Other regulatory functions required to supervise consumer credit licensees.\n\nSource. #10258, eff 1-24-13; ss by #14096, eff 10-3-24 (formerly Ban 103.03)",
